        "content": "![圖解說明](./images/eng_u7_concept1.svg)\n\n英文中表達「未來要發生的事」，最常用的兩大結構是 will 與 be going to：\n\n```text\n               ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n               │              未來式兩大核心文法               │\n               └───────────────────────┬───────────────────────┘\n            ┌──────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────┐\n            ▼                                                     ▼\n     【be going to + 原形動詞】                              【will + 原形動詞】\n     1. 事先深思熟慮的「既定計畫」                           1. 說話當下的「即時決定」\n     2. 眼前有明顯跡象的「必然預測」                         2. 說話者主觀的「信念與預言」\n     - I am going to study tonight.                         - I will help you with the heavy box!\n     - Look at the dark clouds! It is going to rain.        - Robots will help teachers in 2030.\n```\n\n### 1. 肯定句與否定句公式：\n- **be going to 公式**：主詞 + [am/is/are] + going to + 動詞原形\n  - I am going to travel to Japan next month.\n  - She is not going to play video games tonight.\n- **will 公式**：主詞 + will + 動詞原形（will 的否定縮寫為 \\mathbf{won't}，即 will not）\n  - We will win the championship!\n  - They won't give up easily.\n\n### 2. 疑問句與回答：\n- **Yes/No 問句**：\n  - \"Are you going to join the basketball club?\" \\rightarrow \"Yes, I am. / No, I'm not.\"\n  - \"Will it rain tomorrow?\" \\rightarrow \"Yes, it will. / No, it won't.\"\n- **Wh- 疑問句（大考最高頻！）**：\n  - \"What are you going to do this weekend?\"\n  - \"Where will you go for the graduation trip?\""
